/**
 * Episode registry. Each episode gets four compositions in Root.tsx:
 *   <id>-long-hi / <id>-long-en   1920x1080, YouTube long form (Hindi is the main audio, English the extra track)
 *   <id>-short-hi / <id>-short-en 1080x1920, Instagram Reel + YouTube Short (Hindi), English for reference
 * Audio lives in public/episodes/<slug>/mix.wav (English) and mix_hi.wav (Hindi).
 * The Hindi cut plays the English-timed picture through the episode's warp (generated by engine/audio/build_sound_hi.py).
 */
